      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df3a55f6fa434679f836fa|full_name}Affected world is wrld_5129136a-c052-4a53-851b-4529b4512c09. Notable issue is light probes are supposed to update as the player walks into different rooms. When the bug is happening, the room tracking doesn't work and treats the player as if they're always in the spawn room. And again the bug is inconsistent to trigger, sometimes the scripts will load, sometimes they will fail to deserialize.",
